      "value": "@{63c199d2c7d7907610c71afd|full_name} Pretty much most of the time the current restrictions dont even stop the people actually abusing it, which is why instead of nerfing it so hard and making it harder for actual usecases and mutes, individual muting would help a ton instead <3",
